-# Cubical Create 0.2.1-alpha.16
+# Cubical Create 0.2.2-alpha.17
 
 Native feature-parity migration build:
 
@@ -17,7 +17,13 @@
 The native application and rendering engine are distributed together. No system Python is required.
 
 
-## Alpha 16 reliability fixes
+## Alpha 17 exact-output player
+- Play/pause, restart and seek controls on Linux and Windows.
+- Preview frames are rendered at the project output resolution through the same `FrameRenderer.render_output_frame()` path used by MP4 export.
+- The UI scales the finished output frame for display instead of re-laying out the scene at preview resolution.
+- Preview rendering runs asynchronously and drops stale requests while scrubbing, keeping the editor responsive on slower hardware.
+- Alpha 13 animation timing and geometry regression tests remain unchanged.
+
 
 - Linux previews use a fresh PNG and load it directly as a GTK texture.
 - Windows previews use a fresh bitmap for every render.
